      "text": "[3:49PM] #VictoriaIsland #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic on and around McWen bridge leading to and from Bonny Camp roundabout is currently flowing well. Similarly, Ahmadu Bello Way towards Eko Hotel and its return route are experiencing appreciable movement. \n\nThe traffic flow from Bonny Camp underbridge through Kofo Abayomi, Oniru, Kilimajaro, down to Ozumba stretch and back is also in good condition, with the exception of brief holdups at traffic alternation areas.\n\n Furthermore, the route from Ozumba Avenue to Law School, connecting to Civic Center, BJ1004, School corner, and Sand Field heading inward Lekki Phase 1 and back, is moving steadily, again with slight delays at intersections.\n\n Motorists should anticipate minor slowdowns at alternation points throughout these areas at this time. Notably, no obstructions have been reported, and our traffic officers are present at various key locations to manage the flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
